// PC Interactions and Option Handling
#org @gText_GameModifiers_BootingUpPC
This terminal allows you to toggle\ngame modifiers which affect the\lway the game is played.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_ChooseAModifierPrompt
Please make a selection.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_LoggingOff
Logging off...

#org @gText_GameModifiers_ModifierNotYetAchieved
The conditions to unlock this\nmodifier have not been achieved.\pWould you like to enter a password\nto unlock it immediately?

#org @gText_GameModifiers_PasswordIncorrect
[RED]Password is incorrect.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_PasswordCorrect
[GREEN]Password is correct.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_TurnOffPrompt
This modifier is currently on.\nDo you want to turn it off?

#org @gText_GameModifiers_TurnOnPrompt
This modifier is currently off.\nDo you want to turn it on?

#org @gText_GameModifiers_ModifierNowOff
The modifier has been disabled.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_ModifierNowOn
The modifier has been enabled.

// Modifier Descriptions

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InverseBattles_Description
When enabled, type effectiveness is\nreversed in battle.


